flowchart TD
    C[Validated coordinate tuple] --> H[Seed hash / deterministic seed]
    H --> U[Universe profile]
    U --> G[Galaxy profile]
    G --> S[Sector profile]
    S --> Y[Solar-system profile]
    Y --> P[Planet and biome profile]
    P --> M[Moon and orbital profile]
    S --> A[Anomaly and danger modifiers]
    Y --> L[Travel lanes and gate availability]
    P --> O[Occupancy and ownership overlay]
    H --> R[Repeatable generated resources]
    O --> D[Discovery and scan filtering]
    D --> V[Commander-visible map state]
    V --> E[Exploration / colonization intent]
    E --> X[(Persistent database records)]
